+	ok(bu.find("pick_focus(s.units, follow_id)") >= 0 and bu.find("time - float(hurt") < 0 or bu.find("static func pick_focus(units: Array, follow: int)") >= 0, "焦點不看動畫時鐘（暫停、跳轉、固定時鐘截圖一致）")
